"Rank clubs gather hero students of the same rank."
"The B List at Celena North counts almost every B-rank hero student as a member."
"It holds study meetings, private gym time on Sunday nights and occasional outings."
"Celena North has fewer than forty B-rank hero students; Instructor Plim advises the B List."
"The A List, the A-rank club, gets social hours but no private gym time."
"The Superlatives, the S-rank club, gets club gym time."
"B List members unofficially keep The Beat List, tallying the A-ranks each has beaten."
"Meister and Brute combat clubs get private gym time with mentors; Rabbits have no such club."
"Viciously competitive second-year B's make up almost half the B List's active members."
